{"id":"u36","kelas":11,"no":2,"judul":"Eksposisi Analitis","title":"Analytical Exposition","emoji":"📊","ringkas":"Thesis, argumen, dan penegasan ulang","ready":true,"goals":["memahami tujuan **analytical exposition**: meyakinkan pembaca bahwa suatu hal **memang demikian** (*is the case*)","mengenali struktur: **Thesis**, **Arguments**, dan **Reiteration**","memakai kata penghubung argumen: [[firstly]], [[secondly]], [[moreover]], [[therefore]], [[in conclusion]]","memakai **simple present** dan kata kerja berpendapat: [[believe]], [[argue]], [[show]]","membedakan **fakta** dan **opini**, serta memakai bukti untuk mendukung argumen","menulis analytical exposition singkat yang runtut"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di unit sebelumnya kamu berpendapat secara lisan. **Analytical exposition** adalah teks tertulis yang **meyakinkan pembaca** dengan argumen yang tersusun rapi. Teks ini sering muncul sebagai opini di koran, esai sekolah, dan soal ujian."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur analytical exposition","table":[["Bagian","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**Thesis**","memperkenalkan topik dan pendapat penulis","[[Smartphones should be allowed at school.]]"],["**Arguments**","alasan beserta bukti atau contoh (bisa lebih dari satu)","[[Firstly, phones help students find information quickly.]]"],["**Reiteration**","menegaskan ulang pendapat (kesimpulan)","[[Therefore, schools should allow phones for learning.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Pola satu argumen","text":"**Point** (poin) → **Elaboration** (penjelasan) → **Evidence** (bukti/contoh). Contoh: [[Firstly, reading improves vocabulary. Readers meet new words every day. For example, a student who reads daily learns many new words.]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Kata penghubung argumen","table":[["Fungsi","Kata / ungkapan"],["Urutan argumen","[[firstly]], [[secondly]], [[thirdly]], [[finally]]"],["Tambahan","[[moreover]], [[besides]], [[in addition]], [[furthermore]]"],["Akibat","[[therefore]], [[as a result]], [[consequently]], [[so]]"],["Kontras","[[however]], [[on the other hand]], [[although]]"],["Kesimpulan","[[in conclusion]], [[to sum up]], [[for these reasons]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"thesis","id":"tesis / pernyataan pendapat","ex":"The thesis is in the first paragraph."},{"en":"argument","id":"argumen","ex":"Her first argument is about health."},{"en":"evidence","id":"bukti","ex":"Facts are good evidence."},{"en":"reiteration","id":"penegasan ulang","ex":"The reiteration repeats the thesis."},{"en":"convince","id":"meyakinkan","ex":"Strong evidence can convince readers."},{"en":"benefit","id":"manfaat","ex":"Exercise has many benefits."},{"en":"improve","id":"meningkatkan","ex":"Reading improves our vocabulary."},{"en":"reduce","id":"mengurangi","ex":"Recycling reduces waste."},{"en":"cause","id":"menyebabkan","ex":"Too much sugar can cause diabetes."},{"en":"environment","id":"lingkungan","ex":"We must protect the environment."},{"en":"society","id":"masyarakat","ex":"Education is important for society."},{"en":"essential","id":"sangat penting","ex":"Water is essential for life."},{"en":"effective","id":"efektif","ex":"Online learning can be effective."},{"en":"therefore","id":"oleh karena itu","ex":"Therefore, we should save water."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Fakta dan opini","table":[["Jenis","Ciri","Contoh"],["**Fakta**","bisa dibuktikan","[[Plastic takes hundreds of years to decay.]]"],["**Opini**","pendapat, memakai kata penilai","[[Plastic is the worst problem in the world.]]"],["**Opini beralasan**","pendapat + bukti","[[Plastic is harmful because it pollutes the sea.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Opini perlu bukti","text":"Analytical exposition yang baik tidak hanya berkata [[I think it is bad.]] Tambahkan **alasan** dan **bukti** (fakta, data, contoh). Kata penilai seperti [[best]], [[worst]], [[boring]] adalah tanda opini."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Bahasa yang dipakai","table":[["Ciri","Contoh"],["**Simple present**","[[Reading improves our vocabulary.]]"],["**Kata kerja berpendapat**","[[believe]], [[argue]], [[claim]], [[show]], [[prove]]"],["**Modal**","[[should]], [[must]], [[can]], [[may]]"],["**Kata sifat penilai**","[[important]], [[useful]], [[harmful]], [[essential]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Why We Should Read Every Day","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Reading is a habit that every student should have. It gives us knowledge, builds our imagination, and relaxes our mind.","id":"Membaca adalah kebiasaan yang seharusnya dimiliki setiap siswa. Membaca memberi kita pengetahuan, membangun imajinasi, dan menenangkan pikiran."},{"who":"Text","en":"Firstly, reading improves our vocabulary. Readers meet many new words in books, so they can speak and write better.","id":"Pertama, membaca meningkatkan kosakata. Pembaca bertemu banyak kata baru di buku sehingga mereka dapat berbicara dan menulis lebih baik."},{"who":"Text","en":"Secondly, reading reduces stress. Fifteen minutes with an interesting book can make us calm.","id":"Kedua, membaca mengurangi stres. Lima belas menit dengan buku menarik dapat membuat kita tenang."},{"who":"Text","en":"In conclusion, reading every day is useful for our knowledge and our mind. Therefore, every student should read daily.","id":"Kesimpulannya, membaca setiap hari berguna bagi pengetahuan dan pikiran kita. Oleh karena itu, setiap siswa seharusnya membaca setiap hari."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menyusun argumen","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Tom, what is your thesis for the essay?","id":"Tom, apa tesis esaimu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Schools should start later in the morning.","id":"Sekolah seharusnya mulai lebih siang."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. What is your first argument?","id":"Bagus. Apa argumen pertamamu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Firstly, teenagers need more sleep. Research shows that tired students find it hard to focus.","id":"Pertama, remaja butuh lebih banyak tidur. Penelitian menunjukkan siswa yang lelah sulit fokus."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"That is a strong argument because it has evidence. Add an example too.","id":"Itu argumen kuat karena ada buktinya. Tambahkan contoh juga."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Langkah menulis","text":"1) Tentukan **thesis** satu kalimat. 2) Tulis 2–3 **argumen** dengan bukti. 3) Hubungkan dengan kata penghubung. 4) Tutup dengan **reiteration** memakai [[In conclusion, ...]]. 5) Baca ulang: apakah tiap argumen mendukung thesis?"},{"t":"summary","items":["Analytical exposition = teks yang **meyakinkan pembaca**.","Struktur: **Thesis → Arguments → Reiteration**.","Penghubung: [[firstly]], [[secondly]], [[moreover]], [[therefore]], [[in conclusion]].","Pakai **simple present**, modal, dan bukti (fakta, contoh).","Bedakan **fakta** (bisa dibuktikan) dan **opini** (pendapat)."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["thesis","pernyataan pendapat"],["evidence","bukti"],["benefit","manfaat"],["environment","lingkungan"],["society","masyarakat"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar eksposisi.","k":"6cdb751f"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["improve","meningkatkan"],["reduce","mengurangi"],["essential","sangat penting"],["effective","efektif"]],"exp":"Kata kerja dan sifat yang sering muncul.","k":"66424745"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian teks dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["Thesis","pendapat penulis"],["Arguments","alasan dan bukti"],["Reiteration","penegasan ulang"]],"exp":"Tiga bagian analytical exposition.","k":"92b3212d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan analytical exposition adalah...","options":["meyakinkan pembaca dengan argumen","menceritakan dongeng","menjelaskan cara memasak","mendeskripsikan benda"],"answer":0,"exp":"Teks ini meyakinkan pembaca.","k":"ffc9b512"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang berisi pendapat utama penulis adalah...","options":["thesis","reiteration","orientation","materials"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thesis = pernyataan pendapat.","k":"331d74ee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang mengulang pendapat di akhir teks adalah...","options":["reiteration","thesis","arguments","title"],"answer":0,"exp":"Reiteration = penegasan ulang.","k":"27c1756d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata penghubung untuk memulai argumen pertama adalah...","options":["Firstly","In conclusion","Therefore","However"],"answer":0,"exp":"Firstly = pertama.","k":"f6b59d8c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata penghubung untuk menutup teks adalah...","options":["In conclusion","Firstly","Moreover","For example"],"answer":0,"exp":"In conclusion = kesimpulannya.","k":"10739e4e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"Plastic harms fish. ___, we should reduce plastic.\"","options":["Therefore","Although","Firstly","But"],"answer":0,"exp":"Therefore = oleh karena itu.","k":"e94c48b7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang merupakan fakta?","options":["Water boils at 100 degrees Celsius.","Water is the most delicious drink.","Water is boring.","Everyone loves water."],"answer":0,"exp":"Fakta bisa dibuktikan.","k":"5ad0c04a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang merupakan opini?","options":["Football is the most exciting sport.","Football has eleven players in a team.","Football is played with a ball.","A match has two halves."],"answer":0,"exp":"most exciting = penilaian pribadi.","k":"58c1063e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan pada analytical exposition adalah...","options":["simple present","simple past","past perfect","past continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Argumen berisi pendapat dan fakta umum.","k":"a222d56b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks \"Firstly, ... Secondly, ... In conclusion, ...\" termasuk teks...","options":["analytical exposition","recount","procedure","invitation"],"answer":0,"exp":"Penanda argumen berurutan.","k":"eb0a8647"},{"type":"fill","id":"Membaca meningkatkan kosakata kita.","q":"Reading ___ our vocabulary. (improve)","answers":["improves"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"Subjek tunggal memakai improves.","k":"ecafb4c5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Daur ulang mengurangi sampah.","q":"Recycling ___ waste. (reduce)","answers":["reduces"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"reduces = mengurangi.","k":"04ab6303"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kedua, olahraga menjaga kesehatan.","q":"___, exercise keeps us healthy.","answers":["secondly","Secondly"],"hint":"kedua","exp":"Secondly = kedua.","k":"da5afc49"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selain itu, olahraga membuat kita bahagia.","q":"___, exercise makes us happy.","answers":["moreover","Moreover","besides","Besides","furthermore","Furthermore"],"hint":"selain itu","exp":"Moreover = selain itu.","k":"42c72336"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kesimpulannya, kita harus menjaga bumi.","q":"In ___, we must protect the earth.","answers":["conclusion"],"hint":"kesimpulan","exp":"In conclusion = kesimpulannya.","k":"4dd46445"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Siswa seharusnya membaca setiap hari.\"","answer":"Students should read every day.","exp":"should + kata kerja dasar.","k":"d6aec19f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Oleh karena itu, kita harus menghemat air.\"","answer":"Therefore, we must save water.","exp":"Therefore, + klausa.","k":"eea9f880"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"In conclusion reading is very useful","options":["Kesimpulannya, membaca sangat berguna","Membaca itu membosankan","Aku tidak suka membaca","Buku itu mahal"],"answer":0,"exp":"In conclusion = kesimpulannya.","k":"7657a8c9"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Firstly exercise keeps us healthy","options":["Pertama, olahraga menjaga kita tetap sehat","Olahraga itu melelahkan","Kami berhenti berolahraga","Dokter menyuruh kita tidur"],"answer":0,"exp":"keeps us healthy = menjaga kita tetap sehat.","k":"e95aeaae"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ketiga, olahraga murah.","q":"___, exercise is cheap.","answers":["thirdly","Thirdly"],"hint":"ketiga","exp":"Thirdly = ketiga.","k":"dc4cc42e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Akibatnya, banyak ikan mati.","q":"As a ___, many fish die.","answers":["result"],"hint":"hasil","exp":"as a result = akibatnya.","k":"ee2b68af"},{"type":"fill","id":"Penelitian menunjukkan bahwa tidur itu penting.","q":"Research ___ that sleep is important.","answers":["shows"],"hint":"menunjukkan","exp":"Subjek tunggal memakai shows.","k":"c514ad0e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Banyak ahli percaya bahwa membaca itu bermanfaat.","q":"Many experts ___ that reading is useful.","answers":["believe"],"hint":"percaya","exp":"believe = percaya.","k":"ad88502e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka berpendapat bahwa seragam itu perlu.","q":"They ___ that uniforms are necessary.","answers":["argue","claim","believe"],"hint":"berpendapat","exp":"argue / claim = berpendapat.","k":"de73faa4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Air sangat penting bagi hidup.","q":"Water is ___ for life.","answers":["essential"],"hint":"sangat penting","exp":"essential = sangat penting.","k":"09786e37"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita seharusnya menjaga lingkungan.","q":"We ___ protect the environment.","answers":["should","must"],"hint":"modal","exp":"should / must + kata kerja dasar.","k":"43b8b4ad"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita tidak boleh membuang sampah sembarangan.","q":"We ___ not litter.","answers":["must","should"],"hint":"modal","exp":"must not = tidak boleh.","k":"f0dc14f8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang dapat menjadi thesis?","options":["Students should learn a second language.","I have a dog.","It rained yesterday.","Add some salt."],"answer":0,"exp":"Thesis adalah pendapat yang dapat diperdebatkan.","k":"3ee405d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang bukan thesis?","options":["The library opens at eight.","Schools should have libraries.","Everyone must read daily.","Homework should be reduced."],"answer":0,"exp":"Jam buka adalah informasi, bukan pendapat.","k":"f33ff9d4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bukti terbaik untuk mendukung \"Exercise is healthy\" adalah...","options":["Doctors say exercise strengthens the heart.","I like exercise.","Exercise is fun.","Everybody knows it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pendapat ahli adalah bukti.","k":"b6ce242b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai argumen kedua?","options":["Secondly, exercise reduces stress.","In conclusion, exercise is good.","Once upon a time, I exercised.","Mix the flour."],"answer":0,"exp":"Secondly memperkenalkan argumen kedua.","k":"90682dff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"consequently\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["akibatnya","pertama","misalnya","tetapi"],"answer":0,"exp":"consequently = akibatnya.","k":"eb466d2e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"furthermore\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["lebih lanjut / selain itu","kesimpulannya","namun","karena"],"answer":0,"exp":"furthermore = selain itu.","k":"fd92d11f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["Smoking causes many diseases.","Smoking cause many diseases.","Smoking causing many diseases.","Smoking is cause many diseases."],"answer":0,"exp":"Subjek tunggal + verb-s.","k":"503ef316"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["Students should not bring weapons.","Students should not to bring weapons.","Students should not brings weapons.","Students not should bring weapons."],"answer":0,"exp":"should not + kata kerja dasar.","k":"ad2bec81"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Fakta atau opini? \"Indonesia has more than 17,000 islands.\"","options":["fakta","opini","pertanyaan","perintah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jumlah pulau bisa dibuktikan.","k":"c8f31858"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Fakta atau opini? \"Indonesian food is the tastiest in the world.\"","options":["opini","fakta","perintah","judul"],"answer":0,"exp":"tastiest = penilaian pribadi.","k":"aaed8570"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks analytical exposition ditulis untuk...","options":["meyakinkan","menghibur dengan dongeng","memberi resep","menyambut tamu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tujuannya meyakinkan pembaca.","k":"ae9670ee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang paling baik mengakhiri teks adalah...","options":["For these reasons, schools should plant more trees.","Firstly, trees give shade.","Trees are green.","I have a tree."],"answer":0,"exp":"For these reasons memulai kesimpulan.","k":"f8de5a1a"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Penelitian menunjukkan bahwa membaca meningkatkan kosakata.\"","answer":"Research shows that reading improves vocabulary.","exp":"Research shows that + klausa.","k":"96690957"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan lawan kata:","pairs":[["benefit","harm"],["increase","reduce"],["advantage","disadvantage"],["useful","useless"]],"exp":"Pasangan lawan kata.","k":"b2bd3654"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Therefore every student should read daily","options":["Oleh karena itu, setiap siswa seharusnya membaca setiap hari","Setiap siswa membaca kemarin","Siswa tidak boleh membaca","Hari ini aku membaca"],"answer":0,"exp":"should = seharusnya.","k":"bd2517fe"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Research shows that sleep is important","options":["Penelitian menunjukkan bahwa tidur itu penting","Aku meneliti tidurku","Tidur itu membosankan","Penelitian dibatalkan"],"answer":0,"exp":"research shows = penelitian menunjukkan.","k":"e276fcbb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tesis menyatakan pendapat penulis.","q":"The ___ states the writer's opinion.","answers":["thesis"],"hint":"tesis","exp":"thesis.","k":"8e89b5e4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertama, olahraga menjaga kesehatan.","q":"___, exercise keeps us healthy.","answers":["Firstly","First"],"hint":"pertama","exp":"Firstly.","k":"a7001782"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kedua, olahraga mengurangi stres.","q":"Secondly, exercise ___ stress.","answers":["reduces"],"hint":"mengurangi","exp":"reduces.","k":"14bff7ae"},{"type":"fill","id":"Karena itu, siswa perlu berolahraga.","q":"___ , students need to exercise.","answers":["Therefore","Thus","Hence"],"hint":"karena itu","exp":"Therefore.","k":"ff812f3b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Oleh karena itu, kita dapat menyimpulkan bahwa membaca penting.","q":"We can ___ that reading is important.","answers":["conclude"],"hint":"menyimpulkan","exp":"conclude.","k":"452a3f1c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Banyak penelitian menunjukkan hal ini.","q":"Many studies ___ this. (show)","answers":["show"],"hint":"menunjukkan","exp":"show.","k":"c5613f14"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selain itu, teknologi mempermudah pekerjaan.","q":"In ___, technology makes work easier.","answers":["addition"],"hint":"tambahan","exp":"In addition.","k":"d2d923b0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Alasan utamanya adalah biaya.","q":"The main ___ is the cost.","answers":["reason"],"hint":"alasan","exp":"reason.","k":"a6c02874"},{"type":"fill","id":"Contohnya, siswa dapat belajar kapan saja.","q":"For ___, students can learn at any time.","answers":["example","instance"],"hint":"contoh","exp":"For example.","k":"ae8a15b0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Struktur analytical exposition:","options":["thesis – arguments – reiteration","orientation – events – reorientation","goal – steps","identification – description"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thesis – arguments – reiteration.","k":"d347cf8d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan analytical exposition:","options":["meyakinkan pembaca bahwa sesuatu benar","meminta pembaca bertindak","menceritakan kejadian","memberi instruksi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Meyakinkan.","k":"1c09ef25"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Reiteration berisi...","options":["penegasan ulang tesis","daftar bahan","tokoh cerita","jadwal"],"answer":0,"exp":"Penegasan ulang.","k":"671b38ee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"consequently\" berarti...","options":["akibatnya","sebelumnya","misalnya","tetapi"],"answer":0,"exp":"consequently.","k":"62596bd4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang tesis yang baik?","options":["Online learning is more effective than traditional learning.","I went to school yesterday.","Mix the flour and water.","Dear Sir,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menyatakan posisi.","k":"3fb0464a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan:","options":["simple present","simple past","past perfect","future continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Simple present.","k":"ecb6b806"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Benefit\" artinya...","options":["manfaat","kerugian","